                      (   unit_tests.asm):00250         ; unit test for EMIT. Verifies the actual queuing mechanism:
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00251         ; saves OUTHEAD before the call, then confirms it advanced
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00252         ; by exactly one (wrapping correctly via OUTBUFSZ, a power
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00253         ; of two) and that the queued byte at the old OUTHEAD
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00254         ; position genuinely matches the character emitted - not
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00255         ; just that the call returned.
