                      (   unit_tests.asm):01852         ; retrieves the original via R> (verifying R@ genuinely left
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01853         ; it there undisturbed, not just that R@ itself returned the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01854         ; right value once) - confirming "non-destructive" for real,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01855         ; not assumed from the name.
