EB3B ED42             (    forth6809.asm):04806                     STD   2,U
EB3D 3342             (    forth6809.asm):04807                     LEAU  2,U
EB3F 39               (    forth6809.asm):04808                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):04809         
