                      (    forth6809.asm):06409         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
F37A 3710             (    forth6809.asm):06410         TWOSTOREW:  PULU  X                 ; a-addr
F37C 3706             (    forth6809.asm):06411                     PULU  D                 ; x2
